## Third-party

### IBM Plex Sans

`scripts/font-source/IBMPlexSansVar-Roman.woff2`, and the subset built from it
at `src/fonts/`, are IBM Plex Sans, licensed under the SIL Open Font License
1.1. The full licence text is in `scripts/font-source/OFL.txt`.

    Copyright © 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"

The font is embedded in the built `dist/index.html` as a data: URI. Embedding
is permitted by the OFL; the font is not sold on its own and its Reserved Font
Name is not used for the subset.
